        <section id="the-software-development-lifecycle" >
          
            <h2>The software development lifecycle</h2>
              <p>The software development cycle (SDLC) also known as the software development lifecycle process, is the different stages of software development practiced in software development companies. It can be used to improve workflow and remove typical pitfalls and guide the team developing the software whilst taking into consideration timing and costs. Some companies may use different terminology but essentially it is the same process and every project will go through it.</p>
<p>Let's look at the different stages involved in the following activity.</p>


<div class="c-interactive" data-v2l-comp="1A9338FEE8584755AB48BB991EF417A3" data-v2l-interactive="uc/u1_s3_p1_lifecycle" data-v2l-id="animation_container">
